DF(1)                       User Commands

NAME
    df - report mounted filesystem space

SYNOPSIS
    df

DESCRIPTION
    Reads /dev/mounts and displays total, used and available space in 1 KiB
    blocks, percentage used, filesystem type and mount path. mfs and FAT
    provide space counts. Virtual filesystems without block storage are
    omitted. FAT reports usable data clusters converted to 1 KiB blocks.

SEE ALSO
    sh(1), man(1), index(7)
